# Dracur — one of the Dragons of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 9/12 The Dragons — 24 life, bribe 110 gold
# enemy: Dracur (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0993.dck "Dracur (R/G/B, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink 3
#   file dated 2016-02-15; its first 24 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 17 lines (60
#   cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/dracur.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 9) [Tier
#   3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/dracur.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Dragons) — "Dracur" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Dracur
